
metadata:
  book_id: "jami-saghir"
  book_name: "Sahih al-Jami' al-Saghir"
  total_hadiths: "8202"
  available_languages: "ar,en,ur"
  intro: "Al-Albani's authentication of al-Suyuti's al-Jami' al-Saghir: the short comprehensive narrations judged authentic, arranged alphabetically. Presented here in 8,202 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
  intro_ar: "صحيح الجامع الصغير: ما صححه الألباني من الجامع الصغير للسيوطي من الأحاديث القصار الجامعة، مرتب على الحروف. يُعرض هنا في 8202 حديثا بالعربية والإنجليزية والأردية."
  intro_en: "Al-Albani's authentication of al-Suyuti's al-Jami' al-Saghir: the short comprehensive narrations judged authentic, arranged alphabetically. Presented here in 8,202 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
  intro_ur: "صحیح الجامع الصغیر: سیوطی کے الجامع الصغیر میں سے علامہ البانی کی تصحیح کردہ صحیح مختصر روایات، حروف تہجی پر مرتب۔ یہاں 8202 احادیث عربی، انگریزی اور اردو کے ساتھ پیش ہیں۔"
  intro_bn: "Al-Albani's authentication of al-Suyuti's al-Jami' al-Saghir: the short comprehensive narrations judged authentic, arranged alphabetically. Presented here in 8,202 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
  intro_fr: "Al-Albani's authentication of al-Suyuti's al-Jami' al-Saghir: the short comprehensive narrations judged authentic, arranged alphabetically. Presented here in 8,202 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
